; UMML Spatial Graph: (5 + 3) + 2 = 10
; Format: NODE <x> <y> <OP> <IN_A> <IN_B> <OUT>

; Route 5 from West to ALU1
NODE 1 2 PASS WEST EAST

; Route 3 from North to ALU1
NODE 2 4 PASS NORTH SOUTH
NODE 2 3 PASS NORTH SOUTH

; ALU 1: Add 5 and 3, output East
NODE 2 2 ADD WEST NORTH EAST

; Route 2 from South to ALU2
NODE 3 1 PASS SOUTH NORTH

; ALU 2: Add 8 and 2, output East
NODE 3 2 ADD WEST SOUTH EAST

; Route Result to East Boundary
NODE 4 2 PASS WEST EAST